  <div><div class="prod-eyebrow">FARM PRODUCTION</div><h1>Production &amp; Products</h1><p>Milk line, meat line, one sales desk and one stock ledger — every litre and kilo traceable, every sale posted once to Accounting.</p></div>
  <div class="prod-hero-kpis"><div><span>Sales this month</span><b id="productRevenueMonth">Rs 0</b></div><div><span>Milk in tanks</span><b id="productStockCount">0 L</b></div></div>
</div>
